  "story": {
    "title": "The Black Block",
    "bgm": "bgm_adventure",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u06_1",
        "desc": "Morning. The forest path is blocked by a giant black wooden block, taller than Bun. Behind it, on a tree trunk, hangs a big round wall clock with dots instead of numbers, its two hands stopped. On the front of the black block the two letters b and l are carved — the ONLY text allowed in the picture. Bun pushes the block with all her might; Hedgie peeks around it; Pip, beak open, says the two letters in the wrong order and looks puzzled; Pim and Pam sit on top of the block. A small red-and-yellow flag sticks up from the top of the block. Hidden in the picture: the black block, the stopped clock, the flag.",
        "hidden": [
          "block",
          "black",
          "clock",
          "flag"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "Look! A big black block!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l1",
            "ko": "봐! 커다란 까만 블록!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "The clock can not tick!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l2",
            "ko": "시계가 째깍거리지 않아!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Lb? Lb? Lbock?",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l3",
            "ko": "르브? 르브? 르복?"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u06_1",
        "ko": "커다란 까만 블록이 길을 막았어요. 그 뒤 나무의 시계가 멈췄어요. 핍은 bl 을 거꾸로 \"르브?\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What is on the path?",
            "ko": "길에 뭐가 있어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Can the clock tick?",
            "ko": "시계가 째깍거려?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u06_2",
        "desc": "Pim and Pam say the two sounds together, gliding them fast into one, and the giant black block lifts up and slides aside with a puff of sparkles, settling neatly beside the path as a little stair step. Beads clicks three beads on its string; Bun, still pushing, tumbles forward onto the grass because the block is gone. Hidden in the picture: the black block, the clock, the flag.",
        "hidden": [
          "block",
          "black",
          "clock",
          "flag"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "twins",
            "text": "Together! /bl/ /bl/ block!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l4",
            "pop": "bl",
            "ko": "함께! /bl/ /bl/ 블록!"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/bl/ /ɑ/ /k/ block!",
            "audio": "blend_block__beads",
            "pop": "block",
            "ko": "/bl/ /ɑ/ /k/ 블록!"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Pop! Here is the clock!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l5",
            "ko": "펑! 여기 시계가 있어요!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u06_2",
        "ko": "핌과 팜이 두 소리를 빠르게 이어 /bl/! 까만 블록이 스르르 비켜나 계단이 돼요. 번이 앞으로 꽈당.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Where does the block go?",
            "ko": "블록은 어디로 갔어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Who falls?",
            "ko": "누가 넘어졌어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u06_3",
        "desc": "At the clock: above its face is a little round door with the two letters c and l carved on it — the ONLY text allowed in the picture. Pip stands on the block step, beak open with a golden sparkle, and the clock door pops open and the clock's hands start to move again. Bun and Hedgie clap; on a mossy rock below, a clam opens and shuts its shell as if clapping too; a silver paper clip holds a leaf onto the clock. Hidden in the picture: the clock, clapping paws, the clam, the paper clip.",
        "hidden": [
          "clock",
          "clap",
          "clam",
          "clip"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Lc? No! Cl... clock!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l6",
            "ko": "르크? 아니! 클… 클록!"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Tick, tock! Tick, tock!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l7",
            "ko": "똑딱! 똑딱!"
          },
          {
            "who": "both",
            "text": "Clap, clap, clap!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l8",
            "ko": "짝, 짝, 짝!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "시계의 c·l 문 앞에서 핍이 \"르크? 아니! 클록!\" 시계가 다시 째깍째깍! 모두 손뼉을 치고 조개도 껍데기를 딱딱.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Can Pip say clock?",
            "ko": "핍이 clock 을 말했어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What claps with the friends?",
            "ko": "누가 같이 손뼉을 쳐?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u06_4",
        "desc": "The clock ticks happily. The friends rest on the block step where the red-and-yellow flag waves; Hedgie flips a little pancake high in the air from a frying pan; up in the tree, Grumble, woken by the ticking, peeks down — and very softly claps his paws twice, then quickly hides his paws behind his back. Hidden in the picture: the flag, the flipping pancake, the clam, the black block.",
        "hidden": [
          "flag",
          "flip",
          "clam",
          "black"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Flip! Look, I can flip!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l9",
            "ko": "휙! 봐, 나 뒤집을 수 있어!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh! ...Clap, clap.",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l10",
            "ko": "쉿! …짝, 짝."
          },
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "Grumble can clap!",
            "audio": "b3_u06_l11",
            "ko": "그럼블이 손뼉을 쳤어!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "시계가 다시 째깍째깍. 헤지가 팬케이크를 휙 뒤집어요. 나무 위 그럼블이 몰래 손뼉을 짝짝 — 그리곤 얼른 손을 숨겨요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What does Hedgie flip?",
            "ko": "헤지는 뭘 뒤집었어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does Grumble do?",
            "ko": "그럼블은 뭘 했어?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "synopsis_ko": "커다란 까만 블록이 길을 막고 그 뒤 시계가 멈췄어요. 핌과 팜이 두 소리를 빠르게 이어 /bl/! 블록이 비켜나요. 핍은 처음엔 거꾸로 \"르크?\" 하다가 \"클록!\" 시계가 다시 째깍째깍, 그럼블도 몰래 손뼉을 쳐요.",
    "so_far_ko": "핍이 그럼블의 \"쉿!\"을 따라 처음으로 \"sh!\"를 말했어요. 멀리 시계가 멈췄어요.",
    "goal_ko": "두 소리를 빠르게 잇는 bl·cl·fl 을 말해 블록을 치우고 시계를 고쳐요."
  },
